WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.801
After two decades at the

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.737
top of a party in Congress

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:05.672
ushering through massive legislation,

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.074
the bill is passed.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:09.876
Winning the majority twice

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.044
becoming the first woman

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:12.679
to lead the House

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.180
and now losing the majority

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.115
for the second time

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:17.717
as speaker of the House will be in order.

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:19.819
Nancy Pelosi announced

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.187
she would step aside.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:23.223
I will not seek reelection

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:24.624
to Democratic leadership

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:26.593
in the next Congress.

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:27.060
For me,

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.095
the hours come for a new generation

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.231
to lead the Democratic caucus

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:33.833
that I so deeply respect it.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.802
82, the Democrat has represented

00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:38.438
San Francisco in the House for 35 years,

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:39.272
saying

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:41.408
she would continue serving in a Congress

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:43.743
whose makeup has markedly changed.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:46.946
When I came to the Congress in 1987,

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.849
there were 12 Democratic women.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.620
Now they're over 90 and we want more.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.624
The news prompting an immediate shakeup.

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:00.160
Pelosi's current number two, Steny Hoyer

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:02.962
announcing that at the age of 83

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:05.231
he would not run for leadership

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.699
in the current number three.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:07.901
82 year old Jim

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.502
Clyburn signals

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.738
he also will let a new team ascend,

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:14.274
paving the way for Hakeem Jeffries,

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:16.342
a 52 year old Brooklyn Democrat,

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.745
as the likely next Democratic leader.

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.980
I'm very comfortable saying,

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:23.450
I believe that every member

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:25.285
of the Congressional Black Caucus

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:27.320
would vote for Hakeem Jeffries.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.788
Every top two deputies

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:31.124
could be 59 year old Katherine Clarke

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:33.393
and 43 year old Pete Aguilar,

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.128
someone who all expected to run

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:36.362
in the November 30th

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.797
leadership elections.

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.933
Hey, it's a generational change.

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.068
Some have long sought.

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:43.203
I think she's a historic speaker,

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:45.438
as accomplished an incredible amount.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:47.440
But I also think

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:48.508
there are a lot of Democrats

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:49.676
ready for a new chapter.

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.377
The daughter of a Baltimore mayor

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.379
who rose the ranks in her state party

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.882
first became speaker in 2007,

00:01:56.216 --> 00:01:57.350
leading the opposition

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:00.053
against George W Bush over the Iraq war.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.421
Three years later,

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:02.956
shepherding through the Affordable

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.358
Care Act under Barack Obama

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:05.758
after her

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:07.594
party was swept into the minority

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:10.163
becoming speaker again in 2019,

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:12.298
where she battled Donald Trump,

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:12.866
making him

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:15.335
the only president impeached twice

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:19.606
including after January six.

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:21.241
But pro-Trump rioters stormed

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:23.343
the capitol in targeted the speaker.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:24.410
For now, though,

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:25.578
can you imagine a caucus

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:28.948
not run by Nancy Pelosi?

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:30.283
Well, I hope that

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:31.351
we don't have to see that.

